{"id":"05b5dba2baae641d","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-bilinear.md","title":"Bilinear","display":"df-bilinear — Bilinear","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bilinear","aliases":["58-df-bilinear"],"display":"df-bilinear — Bilinear","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bilinear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bilinear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bilinear — Bilinear"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,U,V,W\\in V\">\\(k,U,V,W\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (explicit scalar field, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq(U\\times V)\\times W\">\\(B\\subseteq(U\\times V)\\times W\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k\\)</span> (bilinear predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,U,V,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(U,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,U\\times V,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u_1,u_2\\in U\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle a\\odot_Uu_1+_Ub\\odot_Uu_2,v\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u_1,v\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u_2,v\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;\\forall v_1,v_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle u,a\\odot_Vv_1+_Vb\\odot_Vv_2\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_1\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_2\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,U,V,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(U,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,U\\times V,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u_1,u_2\\in U\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle a\\odot_Uu_1+_Ub\\odot_Uu_2,v\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u_1,v\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u_2,v\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;\\forall v_1,v_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle u,a\\odot_Vv_1+_Vb\\odot_Vv_2\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_1\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_2\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bilinearity means linearity in each argument separately with respect to one shared, explicitly bound field structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; the three vector spaces cannot silently choose incompatible scalar operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (explicit scalar field, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S$ (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,U,V,W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq(U\\times V)\\times W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,U,V,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_V,\\odot_V,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(U,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,U\\times V,W)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u_1,u_2\\in U\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle a\\odot_Uu_1+_Ub\\odot_Uu_2,v\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u_1,v\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u_2,v\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;\\forall v_1,v_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nB(\\langle u,a\\odot_Vv_1+_Vb\\odot_Vv_2\\rangle)\n=a\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_1\\rangle)+_Wb\\odot_WB(\\langle u,v_2\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1846,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d6935a1d07e61f7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"175625664dfe6894","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)$ (bilinear-map predicate, see [[58-df-bilinear]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-bilinear.md|58-df-bilinear]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}